title: Hubertus Heil
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, center
view-if: heil_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Hubertus Heil

Hubertus Heil from Peine co-founded Netzwerk Berlin, served twice as general secretary and was labour minister for seven years. He knows how to hold the party together and how to win a campaign.

- @clear_agenda
- @party_discipline
- @emergency_fundraising
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@clear_agenda
title: Clear the agenda
subtitle: Removes all cards from the hand.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main'] = [];
!}

All items have been cleared from our agenda.

@party_discipline
title: Party discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10

We remind every faction that a divided party loses elections.

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency fundraising
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources += dues

We have gained +[+ dues +] resources.

@snap_election
title: Snap election
subtitle: Ask the confidence question and go for new elections.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if chancellor_party != "SPD" : The SPD must hold the chancellery. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and chancellor_party == "SPD" and spd_in_government
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

The chancellor loses the confidence question on purpose, and the president dissolves the Bundestag. New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

